# "Winter Set": a second hour in one take, for a long listening video (the screen alone, tools/film.py --layout
# center; build/design/SET2.md). Five songs after DeepChord presents Echospace (The Coldest Season for four, Liumin's
# "Bcn Dub" to close), played in Set mode with Transition Mix (the tempo glides over each outro's last phrase, the old
# chord held in the echo, the next pulse on the downbeat). Each song a slot re-made off camera before the film, by the
# panel alone (the same could be done by hand on an FM-1): slots 4-8 (pieces 3-7, Fog .. Haze), so the Set runs from
# slot 4 to the last. The device shows each slot's recipe name; the songs' own names are the captions' and chapters':
#   1 Hoarfrost  (slot 4, Fog)         D minor, 120, Dm7 held, Ambient, 16 + 280 + 16 bars
#   2 Black Ice  (slot 5, Concrete)    D minor, 120, FM7 Dm7 E7 Am7 (16 bars each), Pulse, the rolling bass, 16 + 296 + 16
#   3 Snowfield  (slot 6, Night Drive) A minor, 120, Am7 held, beatless (the kick and the hats muted), 16 + 216 + 16
#   4 Aurora     (slot 7, Pressure)    E minor, 120, GM7 G7 Dm7 D7 (64 bars each), offbeat bass and hats, a negra echo,
#                                      Pulse, 16 + 448 + 16
#   5 Thaw       (slot 8, Haze)        F minor, 123, FM7 EM7 F#M7 BbM7 (32 bars each), Ambient, 16 + 336 + 16
# Between the songs' own movement, a ghost performer's few moves, on the phrase lines (multiples of 8 bars), about one
# every 2-3 minutes; the DJ filter (SELECT) ridden slowly; the sirens twice in the hour. The Arrangement page (SEL)
# a few bars before a move and a few after it (its meters through the move), then the Form page (HOME); now and then
# the scope, the spectrum or the tape (ALGORITHM). The pages between (1.4.0's video, the user's: more variety): the
# Song page (HOME again) at an intro or an outro, then the Key page (HOME a third time) for the key and the tempo;
# the Chords page (EDIT) or the Walk page's wheel (EDIT again) over a chord change. A page changes the picture only:
# the WAV is the same, sample for sample, as with the Form page throughout (no key or knob but SELECT on those pages;
# SELECT is the DJ filter on every page).
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there: the cue sheet (build/film/channel/long_videos/set2/cues.txt). In a Set the
# bar count starts again at 0 on each song's downbeat: each song's first cue waits for the last bar of the one before
# (`bar LAST`), then a bar and a little more (`wait`), so it lands just past the next downbeat (checked: `expect piece`).
# Too long for tools/make_film.sh (an hour of film): rendered in two passes by tools/make_set.sh. The song's state every
# 50 ms (the tempo heard, the place, the faders) goes to 21-set-tlog.txt, for the tempo across each Mix.
# Keys on the Arrangement page (host names): w0-w5 the parts (tap: mute), b0-b4 solo (tap) / throw (held) of the chord,
# pings, bass, hats, kick; w8 Open, w9 Shut, w10 Drop, w11 Echo; w12 Time x2, w13 Freeze, w14 Tape stop, w15 Stutter;
# b7 Wail, b8 Whoop, b9 Hi-lo, b10 Laser. On the Chords page a key is the slot's root (key 0 = F3).
#
# ======================================================================== the setup, off camera ===
# Boot: Basic (slot 1) playing, Endless, on the Form page. Rest first; every page below is reached by its button.
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect playing 0
# ----------------------------------------------------- slot 4 (Fog) -> 1 HOARFROST (D minor, 120, Dm7 held) ---
turn PRESET 3 5
wait 800
expect piece 3
tap SEL
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 0
# Form: Vary 82 (format 35's scale: the amount 40 the song had, the old knob's 40), Motion 20 (Breathes: the loop
# holds), Drift 75 (the record's filter moves the most). Every value the songs rely on is set where it lands whatever
# the recipe has (the recipes moved in 1.4.0's step 5): a knob turned to its bottom, then up to the value; a centred
# one (a layer's Vary trim, an LFO's Drift) to its far end on the value's side, twice (the notch at 0 stops the
# first), then back to the value
spin K2 -100
spin K2 82
spin K3 -100
spin K3 20
spin K4 -100
spin K4 75
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 27
# Song: Intro 2 phrases, Main 35 (280 bars), Outro 2; Kind Ambient (the recipe's)
spin K1 -2
spin K2 15
spin K3 -2
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 18
# Key: root G -> D (Minor, 120: the recipe's)
spin K2 -5
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
# Chord: Change 64 bars -> Hold (Dm7, the walk's home, held all song); one stab a bar, the Pad (the recipe's); its
# Vary -10 (the amount 24, as the old -16 on 40)
spin K3 1
spin K4 -100
spin K4 -100
spin K4 40
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 8
# Chord voice: Attack 0 -> 25 (each stab a swell, as Aries' pad)
spin K1 25
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 200
expect view 31
tap ENV
wait 200
tap ENV
wait 200
expect view 22
# Chord LFO: its Drift -12 (Fog's)
