spin K1 -100
spin K1 38
wait 300
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
# Pings: Vary -10 (the amount 24, as the chord's)
spin K2 -100
spin K2 -100
spin K2 40
wait 300
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 3
# Bass: Vary 0 (the amount 40, Form's)
spin K2 -100
spin K2 -100
spin K2 50
wait 300
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 10
# Bass voice: Octave -1 -> 0 (the record's low end at 60-150 Hz, a drone on D2)
