wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 4
# Drums: Vary 0 (the amount 40)
spin K3 -100
spin K3 -100
spin K3 50
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 19
# Noise: Vary 0 (the amount 40)
spin K2 -100
spin K2 -100
spin K2 50
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 23
# Noise LFO: its Drift -15 (Fog's)
